# P4: the 4 FX switch on Tracker+ and Mini. Project Settings, 4 FX Slots On, back to the Pattern screen: the step grid has FX3 and FX4 columns, a
# step takes an FX3 and an FX4 (the fx34 sets are core code). The list moves by `tap Down` on both (the Mini has no encoder), expect peek fxslots reads the switch.
# Mini (P8): the sim boots on the Pattern screen, no File or Pattern key: Menu box 6 (Down, Right x2) opens File, back to Pattern
# from the File box is Up, Left x2 (box 0).
title: 4 FX flip on the Mini (P8)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
shot fx-before
expect peek fxslots 2
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Down
wait 200ms
tap Right x2
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1000ms
tap F7
wait 1000ms
expect text "4 FX Slots"
tap F8
wait 600ms
tap Down
wait 600ms
tap F8
wait 3000ms
tap F7
wait 800ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Up
wait 200ms
tap Left x2
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1000ms
shot fx-after
expect peek fxslots 4
